        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9580/50, Contemporary 2 Inch Round Drop Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Inch Contemporary Ring Pull is great for cabinet doors, furniture, or cabinet drawers--anywhere that a contemporary design ring pull is desired. This Contemporary 2 Inch Round Drop Ring Pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 3/8 inch into the door's face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used on sliding by-pass doors. Thru-Bolt mounted from the back side with #8-32 screws (just like a cabinet door pull handle or cabinet knob).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 9580/50 2 Inch Round Drop Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter:  1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Max Depth:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Max Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>***This item is discontinued.  Very limited quantities available.***</b></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Inch Contemporary Ring Pull",
                "description": "The 2 Inch Contemporary Ring Pull is great for cabinet doors, furniture, or cabinet drawers--anywhere that a contemporary design ring pull is desired. This Drop Ring Pull can be used on sliding by-pass doors. It is thru-bolt mounted from the back side with #8-32 screws (just like a cabinet door pull handle or cabinet knob). This Contemporary 2 Inch Round Drop Ring Pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 3/8 inch into the door's face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. \r\n",
